I shouldn't go anywhere.

360
00:11:49,701 --> 00:11:51,958
可是你不去看蝴蝶了吗
But-But what-But what about the butterflies

361
00:11:51,958 --> 00:11:53,300
还有墨西哥
and Mejico?

362
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:54,980
克莱尔 我能感觉到
Claire, I can feel it.

363
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:56,638
你母亲现在很痛苦
Your mother is in pain right now.

364
00:11:56,638 --> 00:11:59,560
我们能确定那是树的痛苦吗
Are-Are we absolutely sure it's the tree?

365
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:02,340
因为我有份奶酪茄子正在备受煎熬
Because I do have an eggplant parmesan under the broiler.

366
00:12:02,660 --> 00:12:03,540
我不想小题大做
I don't mean to overreact,

367
00:12:03,540 --> 00:12:06,460
但我想这种情况 我们有必要喉唱一曲
but I think the situation may call for some throat singing.

368
00:12:13,404 --> 00:12:15,960
开始吧 米奇 小卡
Alright. Mitch. Cam.

369
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,240
-好 我先说 -好
- Okay, I'll go first. - Okay.

370
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,500
-我长得高 -高
- I'm tall. - Tall.

371
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:19,380
我很强壮
I'm strong,

372
00:12:19,380 --> 00:12:21,080
我有马特·达蒙同款鼻子
and I have a Matt Damon nose.

373
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:23,040
-得了吧 -那好
- Okay. - Okay.

374
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,680
米奇尔 快说 是我还是马特·达蒙
Mitchell, quick -- me or Matt Damon?

375
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:25,500
别多想 快回答
Don't think, just answer.

376
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:27,027
-好吧 这个给你写上 -当然
- Okay, I'll give you that one. - Yeah.

377
00:12:27,027 --> 00:12:29,271
好 到我了
Um, alright, now me.

378
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,000
完美音高
Perfect pitch.

379
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:31,860
这个宝宝需要的是节奏感
Well, what this baby needs is rhythm.

380
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,417
我一个龋齿都没有
And I've never had a cavity.

381
00:12:34,417 --> 00:12:36,433
我写字好看
I-I have good penmanship.

382
00:12:36,433 --> 00:12:38,600
我有个姨妈活到了110岁
Well, I had an aunt that lived to 110,

383
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,920
她还每天抽烟斗
and she smoked a pipe every day.

384
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:41,760
-我很负责 -我很会带孩子
- I'm responsible. - I'm nurturing.

385
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,720
我也很会带孩子
Okay. I'm nurturing, too.

386
00:12:43,860 --> 00:12:46,540
莉莉还是宝宝时 我每晚都唱歌哄她睡觉
When Lily was a baby, I sang her to sleep every night,

387
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:47,480
用完美音高唱
with perfect pitch.

388
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:50,661
以前每天早上送她上学后
Well, I used to look at her through the window every morning

389
00:12:50,661 --> 00:12:51,620
我都透过窗子看着她
when I would drop her off at school,

390
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:53,078
直到保安拍了我的照片留证
until the security guard took my picture.

391
00:12:53,078 --> 00:12:55,114
好吧 这样吧
Okay, uh... you know what?

392
00:12:55,546 --> 00:12:57,040
由你来捐
You-You be the donor.

393
00:12:57,040 --> 00:12:59,120
我觉得我做不到身为某个孩子的父亲
I don't think that I can have a kid in the world

394
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:00,420
却对孩子的生活不管不问
and not be a part of their life.

395
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:01,820
米奇尔 我觉得我也做不到
Oh, Mitchell, I don't think I can, either.

396
00:13:01,900 --> 00:13:04,860
我的美鼻孩子成为史上第一个美式足球弃踢手
It would kill me to have a little button-nose beauty out there

397
00:13:04,860 --> 00:13:06,720
或是第一个火箭舞蹈队男队员而名震天下
kicking up a storm as the first female punter

398
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:07,920
而我却不能相认 我会难受死的
or the first male Rockette.

399
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,180
还是我们求人家的
We begged them.

400
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:10,540
我们会看起来特别不靠谱
We're gonna look like such flakes.

401
00:13:11,020 --> 00:13:13,260
他们会心碎的 我们该怎么告诉人家
They're gonna be heartbroken. How do we tell them?

402
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:15,140
我们只能彻底坦白
We're just gonna have to be completely honest.

403
00:13:15,260 --> 00:13:16,800
我们可以说微波炉出故障
We could tell them the microwave's been on the fritz

404
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:17,620
害我们不育了
and we're both sterile.

405
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,440
很好 就这么说
Great. That. Yeah.

406
00:13:23,100 --> 00:13:23,460
好吧
Okay.

407
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:26,180
是我们
It's us.

408
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:27,460
好惊喜
What a surprise.

409
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:29,760
亲爱的 米奇和小卡来了
Uh, honey? Mitch and Cam are here!

410
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:31,760
我们很抱歉这样冒昧上门
Listen, we're sorry for dropping in like this.

411
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:34,180
-但有些事我们得告诉你们 -是的
- Uh, but there's something we need to tell you. - Yeah.

412
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:35,289
你们好吗
What's up?

413
00:13:35,289 --> 00:13:37,262
这件事真的很难开口
Okay, there-there's no easy way to say this.

414
00:13:37,262 --> 00:13:40,756
我们不太能接受捐精
Um...we're just not comfortable donating sperm.

415
00:13:40,756 --> 00:13:42,300
听我们解释
And-And-- You know, listen,

416
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:44,280
我们真的深感荣幸
we were so flattered.

417
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:46,660
但我们可能只是一时上头了
But I think we just got caught up in the moment.

418
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,520
我们理解
Oh, we get it.

419
00:13:48,580 --> 00:13:49,360
是的 没关系的
Yeah. No problem.

420
00:13:49,940 --> 00:13:51,360
-真的吗 -完全没关系
- Oh, really? - It's totally fine.

421
00:13:51,460 --> 00:13:52,640
十分感谢你们过来通知我们
Thank you so much for letting us know.

422
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:53,279
你们人最好了
You guys are the best.

423
00:13:53,279 --> 00:13:54,218
当然
Oh. Oh, yeah.

424
00:13:54,218 --> 00:13:55,137
-那好 -祝你们今天愉快
- Okay. - Hey, have a good one.

425
00:13:55,137 --> 00:13:57,047
-当然 -再见
- Sure. - Bye. Bye.

426
00:13:57,599 --> 00:13:59,396
真不敢相信这么顺利
Wow, I-I can't believe how well that went.

427
00:13:59,396 --> 00:14:00,979
是啊 我感觉好多了
Yeah, I know. I feel-I feel so much better.

428
00:14:00,979 --> 00:14:02,940
简直太顺利了
That was...so easy.

429
00:14:02,940 --> 00:14:04,580
是啊 真的好顺利
Yeah. Yeah, like, really easy.

430
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:06,160
等等 过于顺利了吗
Wait, was it too easy?

431
00:14:11,141 --> 00:14:12,053
交给我
I got this.

432
00:14:14,845 --> 00:14:16,840
-我们又回来了 -是啊
- It's us again. - Yeah.

433
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:20,260
刚才是怎么回事
Listen, um... what just happened?

434
00:14:20,260 --> 00:14:23,320
因为我们刚刚破坏了你们的整个生育计划
Because we just cratered your entire family planning,

435
00:14:23,380 --> 00:14:25,940
而你们只说了句"祝我们今天愉快"
and all we get is a "Have a good one"?

436
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,839
你们好像一点也不难过
You don't seem too broken up about it.

437
00:14:27,839 --> 00:14:30,205
不 我们特别伤心
No, no, we're super-sad.

438
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:31,239
我们拉拉就这样
We're just lesbians.

439
00:14:31,239 --> 00:14:33,804
-当然 -是我们不好
- Oh, of course. - Okay. That's on us.

440
00:14:33,804 --> 00:14:35,475
-怪我们 -好了
- That is on... - Okay.

441
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:37,120
是谁在笑
Who's that?

442
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:38,540
-是坎贝尔 -才不是
- Campbell. - No, it's not.

443
00:14:38,580 --> 00:14:39,876
你才是笑起来像男人的那个
You're the one with the masculine laugh.

444
00:14:39,876 --> 00:14:41,580
我也突然意识到
Yeah, and I'm-I'm suddenly aware

445
00:14:41,580 --> 00:14:43,639
我们站在门外聊了好久
that we've been talking outside for a long time.

446
00:14:43,639 --> 00:14:44,920
你介意我们进去坐坐吗
Do-Do you mind if we come in?

447
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:46,702
完全不介意 米奇和小卡
Yeah, no, not at all, Mitch and Cam!

448
00:14:46,702 --> 00:14:48,136
快请进屋
Come on into the house!

449
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:50,814
坎贝尔
Hey, Campbell!

450
00:14:50,814 --> 00:14:53,480
这位猛男是谁
Who's-Who-Who's your hunk?

451
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,120
我是内森
I'm Nathan.

452
00:14:54,500 --> 00:14:54,920
内森
Nathan.

453
00:14:55,546 --> 00:14:57,224
你好 内森 这是
Hello, Nathan. What is...

454
00:14:57,260 --> 00:14:58,680
香槟 怎么 你们在庆祝什么吗
Champagne. What? Were you celebrating?

455
00:14:58,900 --> 00:15:01,820
和一个有着非凡基因的男人
With a man in possession of some pretty remarkable genetics.

456
00:15:02,540 --> 00:15:03,380
我明白了
Oh, I get it.

457
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:05,840
所以我们放弃了你们也毫不在乎
That's why you let us off the hook so easy.

458
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,840
你们本来就不打算用我们了
You were gonna replace us.

459
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:09,180
我们很抱歉
Okay, we're sorry.

460
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:11,060
是的 精子会由他来捐
Yes, he's gonna donate.

461
00:15:11,380 --> 00:15:13,639
我们也不是计划好的 我们刚认识
We did not plan this. We just met.

462
00:15:13,639 --> 00:15:14,871
-你们刚认识 -刚认识
- You just met?! - Just met?

463
00:15:14,871 --> 00:15:16,682
-在哪 怎么认识的 -几点 怎么认识的
- Where? How? How? - When? How?

464
00:15:16,682 --> 00:15:18,628
他是我们的滴滴司机
He was our L-Lyft driver.

465
00:15:18,628 --> 00:15:19,880
他的车非常干净
Man, his car was really clean,

466
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:20,940
他特别会聊天
he made excellent conversation.

467
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:22,600
看看他啊
And I mean, look at him.

468
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,660
你们明白的 对吗
You guys get it, right?

469
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,080
这基因确实该广泛播种
That should be making babies.

470
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:28,500
至少我们能告诉朋友们 有人找过我们
Look, at least we can tell our friends that we were asked.

471
00:15:28,580 --> 00:15:29,360
是啊 你知道吗
Yeah, and you know what?

472
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:31,298
作为第二名也挺好的
Hey, second place isn't bad.

473
00:15:31,298 --> 00:15:32,321
-是的 -没错
- Yeah. - Yeah.

474
00:15:32,321 --> 00:15:33,202
你介意吗
Ooh, do you mind?

475
00:15:33,202 --> 00:15:34,920
我们可以跟你合个影吗
Can we get a-a picture with you

476
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:36,860
让朋友看看 得多强大的对手才能打败我们
just to show all of our friends what it took to beat us out?

477
00:15:37,140 --> 00:15:38,540
-没问题 -麻烦了 谢谢
- Sure. - Sorry. Thanks.

478
00:15:38,820 --> 00:15:40,238
-来吧 -我脱掉上衣会不会更好一些
- Okay. - Would it help if I took off my shirt?

479
00:15:40,238 --> 00:15:42,320
-应该吧 是啊 -好太多了
- Oh, probably, yeah. - In so many ways.

480
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,520
绝对能帮上忙 来吧
Yes, it would. Here.

481
00:15:43,614 --> 00:15:44,563
-露出来啦 -秀出来了
- There is it. - Okay. There --

482
00:15:44,563 --> 00:15:46,138
好货亮出来了
Wow. There...it is.

483
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:46,740
好的
Okay.

484
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,900
你亲雪莉干嘛啊
Why would you kiss Sherry?

485
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:50,420
我也不是有心的
I didn't mean for it to happen.

486
00:15:50,580 --> 00:15:51,280
我一点都不意外
I'm not surprised.

487
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:53,160
我看你跟玩具土豆先生亲热过
I've seen you make out with a Mr. Potato Head.

488
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:54,960
是土豆太太好吗
It was a Mrs. Potato Head.

489
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:56,820
她有蝴蝶结跟擦了口红的嘴唇
She had the bow and the girl lips.

490
00:15:57,540 --> 00:15:59,400
表演开始前我没机会跟她说到话
I couldn't talk to Sherry before the show,

491
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:00,620
所以我只能坐等
so I had to sit through it.

492
00:16:00,700 --> 00:16:02,560
她的第一段演出烂透了 我本来想逃跑
The first sketch was so bad, I tried to bail,

493
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:04,060
但他们把出口都锁上了
but they locked the doors.

494
00:16:04,907 --> 00:16:07,320
当她再度走上台时
Then she walked on the stage --

495
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:08,580
或者我该说是
or should I say,

496
00:16:08,740 --> 00:16:11,160
第一位章鱼总统走上台了
the first octopus President walked on stage.

497
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:12,520
快看
Look.

498
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:14,480
她能一次签署8条法案
She's signing eight bills at once.

499
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:17,060
而且我永远不会签到笔没"墨"
And I'll never run out of ink.

500
00:16:18,300 --> 00:16:20,080
她的演出仿佛环法自行车赛
Her performance was a Tour de France.

501
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:23,360
她就像是火辣女版的我爸爸
She was like a hot, girl version of my dad.

502
00:16:23,495 --> 00:16:27,221
演出结束后 我们聊得很开心 然后就发生了
Afterwards, we kept talking, and...it just happened.

503
00:16:27,300 --> 00:16:28,200
我真的很抱歉
I'm really sorry,

504
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:30,040
但我想我可能对她产生了感情
but I think I may have real feelings for her.

505
00:16:30,300 --> 00:16:33,460
听我说 你以后再也不许见她
Listen to me, you're never going to see Sherry ever again.

506
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:35,020
我得跟曼尼坦白
I have to tell Manny the truth.

507
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:36,200
你敢
Don't you dare.

508
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:37,420
坦白什么
Tell me what?

509
00:16:38,919 --> 00:16:42,489
曼尼 对不起 但我... 亲了雪莉
Manny, I'm sorry, but...I kissed Sherry.

510
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:45,020
我觉得很过意不去
I feel terrible about it.

511
00:16:46,584 --> 00:16:47,386
你还好吗
Are you okay?

512
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:49,060
我会的
I will be.

513
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:50,980
等我把你打死我就舒坦了
After I kick your ass!

514
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:52,112
-给我过来 -赞啦
- Come on! - Oh, hell yeah!

515
00:16:52,112 --> 00:16:52,945
等等 等等
Hold on, hold on!

516
00:16:52,945 --> 00:16:54,900
曼尼 暴力永远不能解决问题
Manny, violence is never the answer.

517
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:55,836
孩子 你不知道你这会造成什么后果
Kid, you don't know what you're doing.

518
00:16:55,836 --> 00:16:56,720
我当然知道
Uh, yes, I do.

519
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:58,960
我得初级武戏课可是拿了"尚可"
I got a "Satisfactory" in Beginning Stage Combat.

520
00:16:59,140 --> 00:16:59,904
开演
And action!

521
00:16:59,904 --> 00:17:00,747
-卢克 你过来 -别这样
- Come here, Luke. Luke! - No, easy, easy.

522
00:17:01,380 --> 00:17:02,820
你别这样
Whoa! Easy!

523
00:17:03,087 --> 00:17:04,073
-你冷静 -你怎么能这么对我
- Easy! - How could you?!

524
00:17:04,073 --> 00:17:06,872
-全天下那么多女人你偏去搞她 -停手停手停手
- Of all the women! Come on, Luke! - No! No! No! No!

525
00:17:07,033 --> 00:17:07,966
别打了
Ah! No!

526
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:08,880
够了
Enough.

527
00:17:09,600 --> 00:17:12,600
听我说 你很伤心我也很难过
Now, listen, I'm sorry that you're hurting so badly,

528
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:14,740
我让你走出那段感情的计划很失败
and I'm sorry that my plan to help you move on

529
00:17:14,740 --> 00:17:15,600
我也很抱歉
was a disaster.

530
00:17:15,820 --> 00:17:17,630
但你是个有广阔胸襟的好男人
But you're a good guy with a big heart,

531
00:17:17,630 --> 00:17:18,920
你会找到真命天女的
and you're gonna find the right person,

532
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:20,120
我向你保证
I promise you.

533
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:23,940
而你呢 你勇敢
And you... it was big of you

534
00:17:23,940 --> 00:17:25,758
跑来跟曼尼面对面坦白做得很棒
to want to tell Manny the truth to his face.

535
00:17:25,758 --> 00:17:27,840
-谢谢 -但你越界了
- Thanks. - But you crossed a line.

536
00:17:27,840 --> 00:17:29,520
你只想到自己而辜负了家人
You put yourself in front of your family,

537
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:32,180
你还伤了一个视你如手足的男人
and you hurt a guy who loves you like a brother.

538
00:17:32,900 --> 00:17:34,720
你这么做让我非常失望
You disappointed the hell out of me.

539
00:17:36,425 --> 00:17:37,663
我得请你离开了
I'm gonna ask you to leave.

540
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:39,800
对不起 曼尼
I'm sorry, Manny.

541
00:17:41,210 --> 00:17:42,212
别难过了 宝贝
Sorry, papi.

542
00:17:44,460 --> 00:17:46,420
我可能得麻烦你让我独处一会儿了
I think I need to be alone for a while.

543
00:17:47,220 --> 00:17:48,020
我理解
I understand.

544
00:17:48,420 --> 00:17:49,680
曼尼 你要记得
Just remember, Manny,

545
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:52,680
当你碰到雨天时 我都愿意陪伴你
I'm there for you whenever there's a rainy day.

546
00:17:52,832 --> 00:17:54,613
因为那些日子不用工作 所以...
'Cause we don't work those, so...

547
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,760
孩子 你要挺起胸膛
You keep your chin up, kid.

548
00:17:58,617 --> 00:18:00,083
一切都会关关难过关关过
It's gonna work out okay.

549
00:18:01,020 --> 00:18:01,840
我知道
I know.

550
00:18:02,420 --> 00:18:03,140
谢谢你 杰
Thanks, Jay.

551
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:08,520
对不起我之前说你从不在乎别人
I'm so sorry that I told you that you didn't care about other people.

552
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:09,820
我当然在乎别人啦
I care about other people.

553
00:18:09,860 --> 00:18:11,060
我内心也很敏感啊
I'm really very sensitive.

554
00:18:11,460 --> 00:18:12,380
那很棒啊
That's great.

555
00:18:12,460 --> 00:18:14,300
那或许明天你可以带乔
So, maybe tomorrow, you can take Joe

556
00:18:14,300 --> 00:18:16,540
去参加小男孩公主派对
to that little boy's princess party.

557
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:18,080
小男孩公主派对吗
Little boy's princess party?

558
00:18:20,040 --> 00:18:22,080
我觉得他也有自由
Eh...I think it's nice that he has the freedom

559
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:23,700
去扮演任何喜欢的角色啊
to express himself that way.

560
00:18:24,860 --> 00:18:25,740
我很不错吧
Pretty good, huh?

561
00:18:25,940 --> 00:18:27,900
他们要求家长也得变装
They want the parents to go dress up, too.

562
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:29,000
慢走不送
Okay, I'm out.

563
00:18:29,900 --> 00:18:32,060
弹了45分钟的西塔琴还是没反应
45 minutes of sitar, and nothing.

564
00:18:32,780 --> 00:18:34,113
她这个人听不进别人的话
She can't be reasoned with.

565
00:18:34,113 --> 00:18:35,440
迪迪就是这种人
That's so Dede.

566
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:37,240
她很明显还在不爽我们
She's clearly still upset with us.

567
00:18:37,575 --> 00:18:39,313
她的确是很记仇
Well, she does hold a grudge.

568
00:18:39,313 --> 00:18:40,214
菲尔
Phil.

569
00:18:40,600 --> 00:18:42,240
克莱尔 能麻烦你帮忙跟你母亲谈谈吗
Claire, could you try and reason with your mother?

570
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:45,460
什么... 好吧 杰瑞 有没有可能
What -- Okay, Jerry, is it possible

571
00:18:45,460 --> 00:18:48,380
是你把放下她的罪恶感投射在这上面呢
that you are projecting your guilt about moving on?

572
00:18:48,380 --> 00:18:50,400
因为那个才不是我妈妈呢
Because that's not my mom over there.

573
00:18:51,320 --> 00:18:52,540
我不是有意说得那么直接
I don't mean to seem indelicate,

574
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:54,320
但感觉你现在有点在说疯话呢
but you sound a little crazy right now.

575
00:18:54,420 --> 00:18:55,800
拜托了 跟树谈谈吧
Please, talk to the tree.

576
00:18:57,213 --> 00:18:58,706
好吧
Okay, um...

577
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:03,300
你好啊 老妈
Hey, uh, Mom?

578
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:07,860
杰瑞想去墨西哥一年
So, uh...Jerry wants to go to Mexico for a year --

579
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:08,660
是四个月
Four months!

580
00:19:09,220 --> 00:19:10,020
我就试试 万一呢
Worth a shot.

581
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,740
他很孤单
And he's lonely,

582
00:19:11,740 --> 00:19:15,160
所以他想带上他的新朋友一起去
so he wants to take his new friend.

583
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:17,040
你说什么
What?

584
00:19:18,346 --> 00:19:19,388
什... 你...
Wh-- You're...

585
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:21,420
真的吗 你不介意啊
Really? You're okay with it?

586
00:19:21,780 --> 00:19:23,560
她说"玩得愉快"
She says "Have fun."

587
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:24,539
她是哪种语气
How did she sound?

588
00:19:24,539 --> 00:19:26,026
语气会不会像说反话 绵里藏针
Did she seem passive-aggressive?

589
00:19:26,026 --> 00:19:27,860
对啊 你最好再确认一次吧 克莱尔
Yeah, maybe you should double-check, Claire.

590
00:19:27,860 --> 00:19:29,480
真是太"谢谢"你了 菲尔
Great. Thank you, Phil.

591
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:34,160
妈 虽然非常想你
Mom, after missing you a lot

592
00:19:34,160 --> 00:19:37,000
而且没有跟你聊过太多别的
and talking about very little else,

593
00:19:38,300 --> 00:19:40,042
但杰瑞遇到了新的对象了
um, Jerry finally met someone.

594
00:19:40,042 --> 00:19:42,820
这个人是迪兰的母亲 法拉
It's -- It's actually Dylan's Mom, Farrah,

595
00:19:42,820 --> 00:19:45,740
杰瑞想带她去墨西哥玩
and he wants to take her to Mexico.

596
00:19:47,660 --> 00:19:49,920
她在听了 接着说
She's listening. Keep going.

597
00:19:49,942 --> 00:19:54,900
杰瑞很担心这么做你会不高兴
Um...Jerry is worried that this would upset you,

598
00:19:54,900 --> 00:19:57,320
但我说你会想看到他开心
but I told him that you want him to be happy

599
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:58,600
并放下过去往前走 对吧
and to move on, right?

600
00:19:59,540 --> 00:20:01,760
快动啊 快动啊
Please move, please move.

601
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:05,808
迪迪 晃动是代表"同意"吗
Dede, does the rustling mean "Yes"?

602
00:20:07,190 --> 00:20:08,300
谢谢你 迪迪
Thank you, Dede.

603
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:09,920
我永远爱你
I will always love you.

604
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:12,199
我需要来点水
I need some water.

605
00:20:12,199 --> 00:20:14,552
-然后咱们去救那"茄子"吧 -没错
- And let's go rescue that eggplant. - Yes.

606
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,680
真的假的啊
That was crazy!

607
00:20:18,720 --> 00:20:21,060
-你看到了吗 -等等
- Did you see that? - Hold on.

608
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:23,700
你... 你妈妈还想说点什么
Your -- Your mom wants to say something.

609
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:23,980
什么
What?

610
00:20:23,980 --> 00:20:25,580
"克莱尔小宝贝
"Hey, Claire Bear.

611
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:28,800
或许你应该多感激菲尔的魔术
Maybe you should appreciate Phil's magic more,

612
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:31,020
尤其他刚刚救了你一命"
especially since he just solved your problem."

613
00:20:31,300 --> 00:20:33,040
真是不敢相信 你真是个天才
I can't believe it. You're a genius.

614
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:34,640
谢谢你
Mm. Thank you.

615
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:35,317
不客气
You're welcome.

616
00:20:35,317 --> 00:20:37,600
人称我为"线王邓菲"可不是浪得虚名
They don't call me Filament Dunphy for nothing.

617
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:38,480
真有爱
That is cute,

618
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:40,340
但你还是会继续卖房子的吧
but you are still selling houses, right?

619
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:43,405
靠 我20分钟后得带人看房
Oh, shoot, I have a showing in 20 minutes.

620
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:49,040
爱你
Love you.

621
00:20:53,180 --> 00:20:55,720
看来我应该多给你浇水啊
Oh, I guess I should be watering you more, huh?

622
00:20:56,220 --> 00:20:56,920
我这阵子一直很忙
I've been busy.

623
00:20:57,500 --> 00:20:58,220
你人都不在这
You're not even here,

624
00:20:58,220 --> 00:20:59,620
我都能感觉到你审视的目光
and I feel like you're judging me.

625
00:20:59,820 --> 00:21:01,860
行行行 我没有忙
Fine. I haven't been busy.

626
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:03,580
我很想你
I miss you.

627
00:21:04,773 --> 00:21:06,500
或许就是因为这样我才不想见到杰瑞
It's probably why I didn't want to see Jerry.

628
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:08,140
他好容易让我想起你
He reminds me so much of you.

629
00:21:08,724 --> 00:21:11,350
也正是为什么法拉总让我来火
It's also why Farrah drives me nuts.

630
00:21:11,923 --> 00:21:13,372
如果我想要家里有个怪人
If I'm gonna have a kook in my house,

631
00:21:13,372 --> 00:21:14,923
我宁愿要你
I'd want it to be you.

632
00:21:16,300 --> 00:21:16,780
菲尔
Phil.

633
00:21:18,060 --> 00:21:19,020
菲尔 别闹了
Phil, stop it.

634
00:21:21,600 --> 00:21:24,300
老妈你闭嘴啦 我就喜欢这发型
Shut up, Mom. I like this haircut.
